OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of hearing days lost at
OL,4,A'leaky' crown court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "leaky" roof and heating problems
OL,7,Fhave cost more than 300 sitting days at
OL,8,FNottingham Crown Court in only two
OL,9,Fyears, new figures have shown.
OL,11,FData released to the BBC has revealed
OL,12,Fhow many times the building's 10
OL,13,Fcourtrooms had to close because of
OL,14,Fmaintenance issues.
OL,16,FMost of those closures happened before
OL,17,Fa #14m upgrade, which was announced by
OL,18,Fthe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) in June
OL,19,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
